{"book":"proverbs","num":19,"verses":[{"en":"Better is the poor that walketh in his integrity, than he that is perverse in his lips, and is a fool.","n":1,"sm":"le uso. l E sili ona lelei o le tagata mativa ua savali i lana amiotonu, i le ua laugutu faapiopio, o ia foi o le vale.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"uso."},{"en":"","sm":"l"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"sili"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"mativa"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"savali"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu,"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"laugutu"},{"en":"","sm":"faapiopio,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vale."}]},{"en":"Also, that the soul be without knowledge, it is not good; and he that hasteth with his feet sinneth.","n":2,"sm":"E le se mea lelei foi ina ia aunoa le tagata ma le poto; o le ua faataalise foi i ona vae e sese O ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"aunoa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faataalise"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"vae"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"sese"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"The foolishness of man perverteth his way: and his heart fretteth against the LORD.","n":3,"sm":"O le valea o le tagata e faapiopio ai lona ala; ua ita foi lona loto i le ALII.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"valea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faapio