s shall not be unpunished, and he that speaketh lies shall perish.","n":9,"sm":"E le faasaoina le molimau pepelo; ma le ua tala pepelo, e fano lava o ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faasaoina"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"molimau"},{"en":"","sm":"pepelo;"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tala"},{"en":"","sm":"pepelo,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fano"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"Delight is not seemly for a fool; much less for a servant to have rule over princes.","n":10,"sm":"O mea faafiafia, e le ono ia i le vale; e matua le ono foi i le auauna ona pule i alii.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"faafiafia,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ono"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vale;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"matua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ono"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auauna"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"pule"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"alii."}]},{"en":"The discretion of a man deferreth his anger; and it is his glory to pass over a transgression.","n":11,"sm":"O le mAafaufau o le tagata e faagesegese ai lona ita; o lona viiga foi lea, ina ua le manatua lona agaleagaina.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mAafaufau"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faagesegese"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"ita;"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"viiga"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"manatua"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"agaleagaina."}]},{"en":"The king's wrath is as the roaring of a lion; but his favour is as dew upon the grass.","n":12,"sm"